### **USER PROFILES**
(?) Can expose certain fields in a UserProfile if we want to enable profiles to connect with each other
PRIVATE: router.get('/', getAllUserProfiles);
- Profiles are confidential information

PRIVATE: router.get('/:userID', getUserProfileById);
- A single profile is confidential

PRIVATE: router.post('/', createUserProfile);
- a user must be authenticated to add finish generating their profile

PRIVATE: router.put('/:userID', updateUserProfile);
